OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday promises to be a fine
OL,6,Fday across the region. There will be
OL,7,Fsome cloud floating around at times,
OL,8,Fbut it will stay dry and some very
OL,9,Fwarm spells of sunshine are likely to
OL,10,Fdevelop. Feeling quite humid too.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThere'll be some warm
OL,13,Fsunshine to end the day, with clear
OL,14,Fspells after dusk. However, cloud will
OL,15,Fgradually increase from the northwest
OL,16,Fovernight, with the odd spot of
OL,17,Fdrizzle later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
