OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FFriday morning will be cloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy drizzle giving way to some
OL,7,Fmore persistent light rain at times
OL,8,Ffrom the northwest. Brightening up
OL,9,Flater in the day, though feeling
OL,10,Ffresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAnother
OL,13,Ffine day is expected on Saturday with
OL,14,Fsome sunshine. Very warm sunshine on
OL,15,FSunday, but turning breezy. Rain
OL,16,Fovernight, clearing Monday morning to
OL,17,Fleave sunny spells for the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
